source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: One rune of content followed by a delimiter a word rune refuses gives the opener up, so Jira renders no effect inside the span; jiro keeps the asterisks as code and stays silent.
-- input.jira --
{{*a*b*}}
-- rendered.html --
<p><tt>*a*b*</tt></p>
-- want.md --
`*a*b*`
-- warnings.json --
[]
